<BaseLayout
  title="How to Pack Clothes for a Move Without Wrinkling or Damage | Legacy Moving Denver"
  description="Packing clothes for a move in Denver? Learn the best methods for protecting garments, avoiding wrinkles, and making unpacking easy — from casual wardrobes to delicate and formal wear."
